said he considered the ads to be a "positive promotion for our great USA." However, the New York district judge ruled that the commercials were an illegal misuse of funds.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea fires missiles after Seoul's hypersonic test</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:00b445dd911bd55ca938a91ea8f8ab6abf4d9eb126d5cdce7500c4ac9d782702</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:12:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T03:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-fires-missiles-after-seoul-s-hypersonic-test/a-79636110--0922c7762fcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-fires-missiles-after-seoul-s-hypersonic-test/a-79636110?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">North Korea has conducted its fourth missile launch in October. South Korea's military called this launch a "show of force" in response to South Korea's successful test launch of a hypersonic missile.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Saudi Arabia: Second strike kills at least 1 at Riyadh airport</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:66f8dda65edcde582b6fb42073a40304c6e141ae2959bf444c410d924299f9b9</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:12:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T22:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-second-strike-kills-at-least-1-at-riyadh-airport/a-79632306--265143324743.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-second-strike-kills-at-least-1-at-riyadh-airport/a-79632306?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sunday's strike came as the King Khalid International Airport remained closed after a deadly attack on Saturday, and after a warning from Houthi rebels in Yemen that "worse is yet to come." Dammam airport was also hit.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UK's Burnham accuses Russia of meddling in Brexit vote</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4c0bbd