ing of Ukrainian "volunteers." But veterans and former prisoners of war share very different accounts.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>German 'lawfare': When lawsuits become a political weapon</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:716ee003dec720d2d582866c7ced26a6a999b668e428be5278eeb096725e3b90</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T15:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-lawfare-when-lawsuits-become-a-political-weapon/a-79615817--29d1d48e91a2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-lawfare-when-lawsuits-become-a-political-weapon/a-79615817?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Left Party is suing two government ministers for accusing them of antisemitism, while Chancellor Friedrich Merz has been sued several times by various parties. Is German politics descending into "lawfare?"</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Trump claims Russia and Ukraine agreed to 'energy ceasefire'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:75929c6a9cfa0f6361115b0e4f19965dae37a5b83158ea69128d8326ee469deb</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T14:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-claims-russia-and-ukraine-agreed-to-energy-ceasefire/a-79634509--966648814544.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-claims-russia-and-ukraine-agreed-to-energy-ceasefire/a-79634509?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump says both sides have agreed to stop targeting oil refineries, power plants and other energy infrastructure immediately.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo XIV to undergo surgery to remove lump on lung</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2b4131153fc05c9b393f1506816cbbf28d854bcb94bd38554683cee5a408c809</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T11:49:00Z</publi