><title>Surrogacy in Georgia is booming, but at what cost?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:639b4da62968ec7735811e6ae093f7429f08edf142b58ed11d1c44705b95b592</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T07:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/surrogacy-in-georgia-is-booming-but-at-what-cost/a-79629971--321e2c4c57d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/surrogacy-in-georgia-is-booming-but-at-what-cost/a-79629971?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Georgia became a hub for surrogate pregnancies after Russia's full-scale invasion of Ukraine in 2022. DW spoke with parents, and those who wanted to become parents, about the hidden costs of a booming industry.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's population is shrinking but not everywhere</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:642981800283bae2d934c7a2c87362a9b66efaaca2d5b96e6089b955ade2c2aa</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T07:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-population-is-shrinking-but-not-everywhere/a-79615807--3e9fde1b2ecd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-population-is-shrinking-but-not-everywhere/a-79615807?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">By 2045, Germany will have more older people, fewer workers and a smaller population overall. Yet some regions will defy this trend. Their success depends on how much they have to offer.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>India's 'Cockroach' movement leaders say 'the fight has just begun' after a large protest in Delhi</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3539507f172358ebe411da46d011ffecc7226a6a779d74fff036d6e73e737db0</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T05:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-s-cockroach-movement-leaders-say-the-fight-has-just-begun-after-a-large-protest-in-delhi/live-79631190--6c364b108dbc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-cockroach-movement-leaders-say-the-fight-has-just-begun-after-a-large-protest-in-delhi/live-79631190?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Leaders of the youth-led protest movement demanding India's election commissioner step down say the "fight has just begun" after they were released from detention following a large demonstration in Delhi. More on DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US: Justice Department probes Trump's press pool boycott for antitrust violation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3672c5f6f468a426746c463558d6b2e90805e3ed5bf79d8b452a234444e0ca28</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T03:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-justice-department-probes-trump-s-press-pool-boycott-for-antitrust-violation/a-79631008--8b147e1a6531.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-justice-department-probes-trump-s-press-pool-boycott-for-antitrust-violation/a-79631008?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Department of Justice is investigating whether the five news organizations violated antitrust laws when they suspended their coverage of Trump in protest. The networks under probe are ABC, CBS, CNN, NBC and Fox News.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Shooter kills 8 people and himself in Pennsylvania — police</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3922f243a02994d14d5b2b3bee170b529ef0f08f1260e790d3bd5a000ec4acef</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T01:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/shooter-kills-8-people-and-himself-in-pennsylvania-police/a-79630735--bb0e9431445c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/shooter-kills-8-people-and-himself-in-pennsylvania-police/a-79630735?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The 45-year-old shooter, who is yet to be identified, carried out the killings at his home in Erie. Pennsylvania Governor Josh Shapiro offered support as the lakeside city grieves.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Storm Isaias leaves 4 dead as it moves across southern US</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dfbe6e9a8e97112367d16748eb65306ac5af3db7f91bce94bf8b3995c936fee5</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T23:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/storm-isaias-leaves-4-dead-as-it-moves-across-southern-us/a-79630125--e52061ff181f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/storm-isaias-leaves-4-dead-as-it-moves-across-southern-us/a-79630125?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The storm, which is now a post-tropical cyclone, had made landfall near Destin, Florida on Friday evening. The storm brings heavy rainfall and powerful winds and has caused mass power outages in Florida and Alabama.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Palestinian president postpones elections until late 2027</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7756f3701a3c0a6e8b89ca26f5735b8b5336c106fc6122bfcb58f8d3338fe09b</id><updated>2026-10-12T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T22:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/palestinian-president-postpones-elections-until-late-2027/a-79630075--cc7afbd0735f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/palestinian-president-postpones-elections-until-late-2027/a-79630075?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Palestinian President Mahmoud Abbas previously committed to holding legislative elections in November 2026. He said that due to "obstacles ⁠posed by Israeli measures" the vote would be pushed back until late next year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
